pkmng5pc
=======

This project is a clean native reimplementation of the Generation V Pokémon
games for PC. It ships NO copyrighted game content.

- No ROMs, save files, graphics, audio, text, scripts, models, or any other
  extracted game assets are included in this repository or its release builds.
- The user must supply their own legally obtained ROM files. All game content
  is read from those ROMs at build time or run time on the user's machine.
- "Pokémon", "Nintendo DS", and related names are trademarks of Nintendo,
  Creatures Inc., GAME FREAK inc., and The Pokémon Company. This project is
  not affiliated with or endorsed by any of them.
- Reverse-engineered knowledge (file formats, addresses, decompiled logic) is
  documented for interoperability; the content it describes is not distributed.

